1
00:00:09,455 --> 00:00:13,918
KOCHIKAME

2
00:00:14,127 --> 00:00:17,004
Ah, summer's here again

3
00:00:17,213 --> 00:00:19,924
It's come, it's arrived, it's here

4
00:00:20,133 --> 00:00:23,010
Ah, summer's here again

5
00:00:23,219 --> 00:00:25,596
It's come, it's arrived, here it is!

6
00:00:25,805 --> 00:00:28,850
Big waves, small waves, tiny waves and middle-size waves

7
00:00:29,058 --> 00:00:31,477
Here they come on the southern wind

8
00:00:31,686 --> 00:00:34,730
Big boobs, small boobs, tiny boobs and middle-size boobs

9
00:00:34,939 --> 00:00:37,733
At the beach Jiggle, jiggle, jiggle!

10
00:00:37,942 --> 00:00:40,736
Ah, summer's here again

11
00:00:40,945 --> 00:00:43,781
It's come, it's arrived, it's here

12
00:00:43,990 --> 00:00:46,534
Ah, summer's here again

13
00:00:46,784 --> 00:00:49,245
It's come, it's arrived, it's here already!

14
00:00:49,454 --> 00:00:52,498
Big waves, small waves, tiny waves and middle-size waves

15
00:00:52,707 --> 00:00:55,334
Here they come on the southern wind

16
00:00:55,543 --> 00:00:58,337
Big butts, small butts, tiny butts and middle-size butts

17
00:00:58,546 --> 00:01:02,842
At the beach Bounce, bounce, bounce!

18
00:01:05,928 --> 00:01:15,354
Here they come on the southern wind

19
00:01:17,815 --> 00:01:21,819
Bouncing at the beach Jiggling at the beach

20
00:01:23,154 --> 00:01:24,322
Want you!

21
00:01:28,284 --> 00:01:34,123
ROWDY, RECKLESS TROUBLEMAKERS!

22
00:01:35,374 --> 00:01:39,837
Recently in Tokyo, especially in our jurisdiction,

23
00:01:40,046 --> 00:01:42,340
there have been a string of traffic accidents.

24
00:01:42,548 --> 00:01:48,596
So, a road safety workshop will be held in this district next week.

25
00:01:49,138 --> 00:01:53,518
All members of this police station will also participate as instructors.

26
00:01:53,726 --> 00:01:57,271
I want you to think of ideas for teaching kids to understand...

27
00:02:01,192 --> 00:02:03,694
All these accidents are a big problem, Ryotsu.

28
00:02:03,903 --> 00:02:05,071
I agree, sir.

29
00:02:05,279 --> 00:02:07,573
There's a guy who races around on his bicycle.

30
00:02:07,782 --> 00:02:08,991
What a jerk.

31
00:02:09,200 --> 00:02:11,869
And a guy who cycles through red lights.

32
00:02:12,078 --> 00:02:13,704
Must be a jerk too.

33
00:02:13,913 --> 00:02:17,041
And a guy who crashes his bicycle into a grocery storefront.

34
00:02:17,250 --> 00:02:18,417
He's an idiot.

35
00:02:18,626 --> 00:02:22,046
And a guy who ignores people and keeps building plastic models.

36
00:02:22,255 --> 00:02:24,006
That's outrageous.

37
00:02:24,215 --> 00:02:27,343
You idiot! Those are all things you did!

38
00:02:27,552 --> 00:02:28,844
I'm listening!

39
00:02:29,053 --> 00:02:32,223
Building plastic models helps me to stay focused!

40
00:02:33,432 --> 00:02:36,435
Don't be silly! You can't get away with such nonsense!

41
00:02:37,395 --> 00:02:39,063
It's the same as your tea drinking!

42
00:02:39,272 --> 00:02:41,732
Don't compare plastic models to tea!

43
00:02:41,941 --> 00:02:44,235
What about the road safety workshop?

44
00:02:44,443 --> 00:02:45,444
No idea.

45
00:02:45,653 --> 00:02:50,575
Anyway, come up with some accident prevention ideas before the event!

46
00:02:50,783 --> 00:02:52,493
Gimme a break.

47
00:02:52,702 --> 00:02:55,580
How to prevent accidents? Easy!

48
00:02:55,788 --> 00:02:58,583
Nobody should drive a car.

49
00:02:58,791 --> 00:03:01,586
I'm very busy building this plastic model. Damn it!

50
00:03:03,087 --> 00:03:05,339
Umm, excuse me.

51
00:03:05,923 --> 00:03:07,758
Yes, can I help you?

52
00:03:11,178 --> 00:03:15,266
Well, is Ryotsu here?

53
00:03:15,891 --> 00:03:17,685
Hey! It's Honda!

54
00:03:17,894 --> 00:03:19,812
It's been a while.

55
00:03:20,021 --> 00:03:21,272
Ryo-chan's junior?

56
00:03:21,689 --> 00:03:26,485
Nice to meet you. I'm Honda, traffic police.

57
00:03:26,694 --> 00:03:30,948
Actually, I'm going to move into the same dorm as Ryotsu soon,

58
00:03:31,157 --> 00:03:33,117
so I came to say hello today.

59
00:03:33,326 --> 00:03:35,244
"I'M HONDA. NICE TO MEET YOU!" "SURARA"

60
00:03:35,453 --> 00:03:36,913
Oh, it looks delicious!

61
00:03:37,121 --> 00:03:40,207
I baked it myself. It's a chocolate cake.

62
00:03:40,791 --> 00:03:43,753
Don't you think Surara-chan's face is cute?

63
00:03:43,961 --> 00:03:45,504
Surara-chan?

64
00:03:45,713 --> 00:03:47,632
She's an anime heroine.

65
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:51,552
Surara, Girl of the Highlands is very popular at the moment.

66
00:03:52,428 --> 00:03:58,476
Her voice actress, Maya Katsuragi, is also super cute!

67
00:03:58,684 --> 00:03:59,936
Don't say "super."

68
00:04:00,144 --> 00:04:01,395
But...

69
00:04:05,441 --> 00:04:06,359
Hell yeah!

70
00:04:06,567 --> 00:04:09,278
I'm the best damn biker there is!

71
00:04:10,613 --> 00:04:14,700
The group of speeding bikers, stop at once!

72
00:04:14,909 --> 00:04:16,619
There's no way they'll stop!

73
00:04:17,244 --> 00:04:18,663
Hey! Stop!

74
00:04:21,123 --> 00:04:22,166
I'm scared!

75
00:04:22,917 --> 00:04:24,460
Scary, scary, bike gangs are scary.

76
00:04:25,294 --> 00:04:26,879
They're speeding like crazy.

77
00:04:27,088 --> 00:04:29,131
Komachi and Naoko are chasing them.

78
00:04:31,509 --> 00:04:33,386
That tiny police car won't give up!

79
00:04:33,594 --> 00:04:36,347
Our machines are much better than theirs!

80
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:43,020
It's no use. We're too slow.

81
00:04:43,229 --> 00:04:47,024
-This car is no match for modified bikes. -Stop! Wait! Behave yourselves!

82
00:04:47,900 --> 00:04:50,319
Somebody, stop those bikers!

83
00:04:53,322 --> 00:04:54,448
Honda!

84
00:04:54,782 --> 00:04:55,783
Yes!

85
00:04:56,742 --> 00:04:58,744
Hey, you came here by bike, right?

86
00:04:58,953 --> 00:05:02,665
Y-Yes, I never go anywhere without my bike.

87
00:05:02,873 --> 00:05:04,750
Good! Honda, you chase the bikers!

88
00:05:04,959 --> 00:05:05,918
What?

89
00:05:06,127 --> 00:05:08,921
They're so scary. I'm not good at such...

90
00:05:09,130 --> 00:05:10,923
Just get on your bike!

91
00:05:11,132 --> 00:05:12,091
D-Do I have to?

92
00:05:12,299 --> 00:05:14,385
You're worth a thousand men!

93
00:05:15,469 --> 00:05:16,429
I don't think—

94
00:05:16,637 --> 00:05:18,139
No, I can't do it!

95
00:05:18,347 --> 00:05:20,558
Stop grumbling and get on the bike!

96
00:05:20,766 --> 00:05:22,226
Stop, Ryo-chan!

97
00:05:22,435 --> 00:05:23,936
I feel sorry for Officer Honda.

98
00:05:24,145 --> 00:05:25,938
Just get on it already!

99
00:05:27,648 --> 00:05:28,524
No, Ryotsu...

100
00:05:48,544 --> 00:05:52,339
All right! I'm going all out again today!

101
00:05:53,382 --> 00:05:54,800
W-Who is this guy...?

102
00:05:55,718 --> 00:05:58,095
I'm Honda, traffic police!

103
00:06:06,020 --> 00:06:08,022
Amazing bike technique!

104
00:06:12,818 --> 00:06:15,237
You ready, Ryotsu?

105
00:06:15,446 --> 00:06:16,947
Sure, let's go!

106
00:06:19,283 --> 00:06:20,117
Let's rock!

107
00:06:24,121 --> 00:06:26,040
What happened to him?

108
00:06:26,499 --> 00:06:28,667
It's like he's a different person than before.

109
00:06:32,421 --> 00:06:34,173
Hey, stop your bikes!

110
00:06:34,381 --> 00:06:36,342
We can't see them anymore.

111
00:06:36,926 --> 00:06:38,427
What was that?

112
00:06:38,677 --> 00:06:40,846
It looked like a police motorcycle.

113
00:06:41,263 --> 00:06:45,017
A burnished silver carburetor! Soul-stirring exhaust notes!

114
00:06:45,226 --> 00:06:46,644
My heart is always revved up!

115
00:06:46,852 --> 00:06:48,854
It's shaking me up my butt!

116
00:06:49,063 --> 00:06:51,941
There you are! I've got you, cockroaches!

117
00:06:53,859 --> 00:06:56,695
Yikes, it's a cop bike! Let's get outta here!

118
00:06:57,029 --> 00:06:58,989
You think you can get away from me?

119
00:06:59,198 --> 00:07:00,699
Stop right there, you jerks!

120
00:07:22,138 --> 00:07:23,180
What the heck?

121
00:07:23,389 --> 00:07:24,557
What happened?

122
00:07:24,849 --> 00:07:25,683
Yeah!

123
00:07:25,891 --> 00:07:27,643
You came too late, ladies.

124
00:07:27,852 --> 00:07:30,563
I, Honda, have kicked them to the curb!

125
00:07:31,647 --> 00:07:33,149
He's so cool!

126
00:07:33,357 --> 00:07:34,608
What happened?

127
00:07:34,817 --> 00:07:37,945
D-Did Officer Honda really do this?

128
00:07:38,154 --> 00:07:39,572
Yes, that's right!

129
00:07:40,030 --> 00:07:41,866
Honda used to be in a biker gang.

130
00:07:42,074 --> 00:07:44,827
He's now a motorcycle cop in the traffic police,

131
00:07:45,452 --> 00:07:48,330
but once he gets on his bike, his personality totally changes.

132
00:07:48,539 --> 00:07:53,836
He's called the Devil on Two Wheels, feared by everyone on the streets.

133
00:07:54,670 --> 00:07:55,588
The Devil...

134
00:07:55,796 --> 00:07:56,672
On Two Wheels...

135
00:07:56,881 --> 00:07:58,632
The engine is warmed up.

136
00:07:58,841 --> 00:08:01,135
You wanna go on another ride, Ryotsu?

137
00:08:01,343 --> 00:08:03,345
Yeah, go for it!

138
00:08:07,016 --> 00:08:08,309
The Devil on Two Wheels...

139
00:08:08,517 --> 00:08:09,393
No way...

140
00:08:12,229 --> 00:08:14,690
I think that traffic light was red.

141
00:08:14,899 --> 00:08:16,066
Ha, I don't care.

142
00:08:16,275 --> 00:08:19,320
It ain't a violation if nobody sees us, you know.

143
00:08:20,946 --> 00:08:21,989
They saw us!

144
00:08:22,531 --> 00:08:25,826
Imagine ignoring a traffic light in front of Honda. Poor guy!

145
00:08:26,035 --> 00:08:27,494
I'm feeling hot, baby!

146
00:08:27,828 --> 00:08:30,080
Hey, shouldn't we stop?

147
00:08:30,289 --> 00:08:32,249
If I don't wanna stop, I'm not gonna.

148
00:08:38,672 --> 00:08:39,506
What are you doing?

149
00:08:39,715 --> 00:08:41,342
This is an aerial attack!

150
00:08:44,511 --> 00:08:45,471
License, please!

151
00:08:45,804 --> 00:08:47,473
W-what are you doing?

152
00:08:49,099 --> 00:08:51,602
What are you doing, ignoring the traffic lights?

153
00:08:51,810 --> 00:08:52,895
I'm sorry!

154
00:08:53,103 --> 00:08:54,772
Did he have to go this far?

155
00:08:55,439 --> 00:08:57,816
Hey, move your car right now!

156
00:08:58,025 --> 00:08:59,652
B-But the engine is...

157
00:08:59,860 --> 00:09:02,029
What? You're saying it's my fault?

158
00:09:02,238 --> 00:09:03,238
Uh, no, it's...

159
00:09:03,447 --> 00:09:05,950
You got something to say? Huh?

160
00:09:09,578 --> 00:09:11,497
You idiots!

161
00:09:12,122 --> 00:09:15,501
Even if they broke the law, you destroyed three bikes and a car,

162
00:09:15,709 --> 00:09:18,003
as well as causing a huge traffic jam!

163
00:09:18,212 --> 00:09:21,090
What makes you think this is okay?

164
00:09:21,298 --> 00:09:22,967
-I'm sorry... -In the first place...

165
00:09:23,425 --> 00:09:26,470
Come on, Chief. Honda regrets what he did.

166
00:09:26,679 --> 00:09:28,597
Let's give him a break for today.

167
00:09:28,806 --> 00:09:30,599
You encouraged him, didn't you?

168
00:09:30,808 --> 00:09:33,268
No way! That's ridiculous!

169
00:09:33,477 --> 00:09:35,980
He said he wanted to go.

170
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:39,566
You told me to go, Ryotsu...

171
00:09:39,775 --> 00:09:42,987
Don't be silly, Honda-kun. I never said that.

172
00:09:43,570 --> 00:09:45,906
So, you were the ringleader after all.

173
00:09:46,115 --> 00:09:47,324
Well, I just...

174
00:09:47,533 --> 00:09:50,035
No more excuses!

175
00:09:50,244 --> 00:09:58,002
Ryotsu! Your punishment is to read 100 traffic safety books!

176
00:09:58,210 --> 00:10:00,170
-Eek! -I'm sorry!

177
00:10:00,462 --> 00:10:03,173
Finish all of them before the workshop!

178
00:10:03,382 --> 00:10:06,176
Jeez! All of these?

179
00:10:11,724 --> 00:10:12,808
It's complete.

180
00:10:13,017 --> 00:10:18,063
Powered by a 1,750 horsepower, two-stage, three-speed supercharged engine,

181
00:10:18,272 --> 00:10:22,234
a German masterpiece that streaked through the skies of Europe,

182
00:10:22,443 --> 00:10:27,823
The Junkers Jumo 213H, also known as the Tank 152.

183
00:10:28,032 --> 00:10:31,660
Ryo-chan, are you studying traffic safety?

184
00:10:31,869 --> 00:10:35,122
If you don't read the books, the chief will shout at you again.

185
00:10:35,622 --> 00:10:37,541
Who can read books like these?

186
00:10:37,750 --> 00:10:41,086
And you can't criticize me while you're playing with a doll.

187
00:10:41,503 --> 00:10:45,632
I'm not playing. The chief asked me to make a doll.

188
00:10:45,841 --> 00:10:48,844
We're going to use it in the road safety workshop.

189
00:10:49,428 --> 00:10:52,306
The chief wants to do a car crash test

190
00:10:52,514 --> 00:10:54,808
on this doll that looks like you.

191
00:10:55,350 --> 00:11:00,314
W-What? Crash a car into a doll that looks like me?

192
00:11:00,898 --> 00:11:02,024
I won't let him!

193
00:11:02,816 --> 00:11:04,985
Typical of that sneaky chief!

194
00:11:05,194 --> 00:11:08,447
He's gonna take out his grudges on this doll!

195
00:11:08,655 --> 00:11:09,865
Who's sneaky?

196
00:11:11,742 --> 00:11:14,620
Sneaky Chief... Uh, I mean I wanna eat streaky beef...

197
00:11:14,828 --> 00:11:15,829
Not my best joke.

198
00:11:16,038 --> 00:11:19,249
I'm so glad to see you're doing well.

199
00:11:19,458 --> 00:11:24,588
You promised to read 100 traffic safety books by tomorrow's workshop.

200
00:11:24,797 --> 00:11:26,715
Y-Yes, I did.

201
00:11:26,924 --> 00:11:30,094
Be sure to come tomorrow, Ryotsu.

202
00:11:30,302 --> 00:11:31,553
Of course.

203
00:11:31,762 --> 00:11:35,265
I'm so excited for tomorrow, I may not sleep tonight!

204
00:11:35,599 --> 00:11:39,895
I'm counting on you to play a big role.

205
00:11:41,063 --> 00:11:44,817
What's with that creepy laugh?

206
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:51,865
"KAMEARI DRIVING SCHOOL ROAD SAFETY WORKSHOP"

207
00:11:55,661 --> 00:11:59,748
Has Ryotsu arrived yet? He'd better not have run away.

208
00:11:59,957 --> 00:12:01,166
I think he'll come.

209
00:12:01,375 --> 00:12:02,918
No matter how much he complains,

210
00:12:03,127 --> 00:12:05,796
he's someone who can't go against what his chief says.

211
00:12:06,130 --> 00:12:10,634
Even if he's late, he'll just walk over with a calm expression.

212
00:12:10,843 --> 00:12:16,181
He might even skip over with a big smile, saying, "Hello there."

213
00:12:16,390 --> 00:12:18,934
I can't stand that attitude of his.

214
00:12:19,143 --> 00:12:20,394
That's going too far.

215
00:12:21,019 --> 00:12:23,564
Sorry I'm late, Chief!

216
00:12:24,481 --> 00:12:27,484
What were you doing, Ryotsu? What time do you call this?

217
00:12:27,693 --> 00:12:30,737
Well, my alarm clock suddenly stopped. It's not my fault.

218
00:12:30,946 --> 00:12:33,615
And then my bike got a flat tire and the bus didn't come.

219
00:12:33,824 --> 00:12:37,327
So I had no choice but to run all the way here. It's true!

220
00:12:37,536 --> 00:12:41,331
You idiot! Don't blame others for everything!

221
00:12:41,915 --> 00:12:44,710
Chief, people are watching.

222
00:12:45,752 --> 00:12:51,091
Oh, I don't blame you. Your alarm broke and the bus was late.

223
00:12:53,427 --> 00:12:57,014
And you've studied the traffic laws like I asked, haven't you?

224
00:12:57,222 --> 00:12:58,599
O-Of course, sir.

225
00:12:58,932 --> 00:13:03,854
From head to toe, I'm full of traffic safety!

226
00:13:05,022 --> 00:13:06,773
Oh, they're laughing!

227
00:13:06,982 --> 00:13:08,066
Stop fooling around!

228
00:13:08,275 --> 00:13:11,069
Chief, we're in front of people.

229
00:13:11,278 --> 00:13:16,617
Well, you wrapped difficult traffic signs in a gag to teach everyone.

230
00:13:16,825 --> 00:13:19,536
What a good and nice idea.

231
00:13:20,204 --> 00:13:23,916
That's okay. You have your role to play.

232
00:13:24,124 --> 00:13:28,295
You're up to something, Chief. But so am I.

233
00:13:32,174 --> 00:13:35,928
Sounds like we might be in for a scary road safety workshop.

234
00:13:36,136 --> 00:13:37,679
Do you think it'll be okay?

235
00:13:37,888 --> 00:13:42,893
Well, to protect people in this district from traffic accidents and crimes,

236
00:13:43,101 --> 00:13:45,646
we're working day and night.

237
00:13:45,854 --> 00:13:47,981
However, in traffic safety, each of you...

238
00:13:48,190 --> 00:13:51,777
The "if I show up late, it'll be over" plan failed, huh?

239
00:13:51,985 --> 00:13:53,654
Time for plan B.

240
00:13:53,862 --> 00:13:56,031
Hey, Honda! Can you hear me?

241
00:13:56,406 --> 00:13:59,743
What? I can't do such a thing.

242
00:14:00,118 --> 00:14:04,748
Besides, I'm on patrol... Well, I am kind of slacking off.

243
00:14:04,957 --> 00:14:07,501
You dare disobey me?

244
00:14:07,709 --> 00:14:09,670
Okay, okay! I'll go!

245
00:14:09,878 --> 00:14:10,754
Good.

246
00:14:10,963 --> 00:14:12,422
Jeez, I have no choice.

247
00:14:26,144 --> 00:14:29,273
I'm on it, Ryotsu!

248
00:14:29,565 --> 00:14:32,359
...So, we hope you'll take this opportunity...

249
00:14:32,567 --> 00:14:34,778
Come on, this isn't a karaoke bar for old men.

250
00:14:34,987 --> 00:14:36,780
Stop hogging the microphone.

251
00:14:36,989 --> 00:14:38,156
Officer Ryotsu!

252
00:14:38,949 --> 00:14:40,826
W-What is it, sir?

253
00:14:41,076 --> 00:14:44,997
Please prepare the road safety corner for kids.

254
00:14:46,581 --> 00:14:48,625
"ROAD SAFETY CORNER FOR KIDS"

255
00:14:52,462 --> 00:14:54,172
Hello, boys and girls.

256
00:14:54,381 --> 00:14:58,927
You are so small that it's difficult for car drivers to see you.

257
00:14:59,136 --> 00:15:00,637
So, please be careful.

258
00:15:00,846 --> 00:15:02,723
Okay!

259
00:15:03,223 --> 00:15:06,852
Chief, you're trying to make fun of me for your own enjoyment.

260
00:15:07,185 --> 00:15:11,481
When you cross a crosswalk, make sure you put your hand up.

261
00:15:11,690 --> 00:15:12,733
Okay!

262
00:15:17,654 --> 00:15:19,656
Kankichi-chan, watch out!

263
00:15:24,119 --> 00:15:27,789
Just like this, you never know when a car might suddenly pull out.

264
00:15:27,998 --> 00:15:29,249
-So be careful. -Got it!

265
00:15:29,458 --> 00:15:30,459
Damn it...

266
00:15:31,001 --> 00:15:35,172
Next, bicycle accidents are common among elementary school children.

267
00:15:35,797 --> 00:15:38,759
The most common bicycle accident involves turning trucks.

268
00:15:38,967 --> 00:15:40,844
Let's recreate the scene here.

269
00:15:45,515 --> 00:15:47,351
Damn, this is ridiculous!

270
00:15:47,559 --> 00:15:50,520
Why do I have to dress like this?

271
00:15:50,729 --> 00:15:53,732
Hey! Don't forget you're an elementary school kid!

272
00:15:53,940 --> 00:15:54,775
Kankichi-kun!

273
00:15:56,026 --> 00:15:57,694
Yeah, I'm sorry.

274
00:15:57,903 --> 00:15:58,737
Good.

275
00:15:59,112 --> 00:16:00,781
Let's start with a left turn.

276
00:16:00,989 --> 00:16:05,243
Cyclists should be especially careful of large trucks.

277
00:16:05,911 --> 00:16:09,373
When a large truck turns at an intersection like this,

278
00:16:09,581 --> 00:16:13,251
its rear wheels could hit this boy due to the different paths

279
00:16:13,460 --> 00:16:15,671
taken by the front and rear wheels.

280
00:16:15,879 --> 00:16:19,925
I'm going to demonstrate this with this boy, so please watch closely.

281
00:16:20,133 --> 00:16:22,719
Chief! Don't hit my head so many times!

282
00:16:22,928 --> 00:16:23,845
I'm not Chief!

283
00:16:24,054 --> 00:16:26,014
I'm a large truck driver!

284
00:16:26,223 --> 00:16:28,725
Demonstrate it properly, little kid!

285
00:16:28,934 --> 00:16:30,268
All right, everyone!

286
00:16:30,477 --> 00:16:33,522
This guy! Keep your eyes on this guy!

287
00:16:33,730 --> 00:16:35,774
Now, let's start.

288
00:16:35,982 --> 00:16:37,275
When a truck turns,

289
00:16:37,484 --> 00:16:41,279
the rear wheels can move further inward than expected.

290
00:16:41,488 --> 00:16:45,242
As a result, the truck will definitely run over that boy.

291
00:16:47,536 --> 00:16:50,831
Damn it! I won't fall for his trap so easily!

292
00:16:51,039 --> 00:16:54,334
Watch. The rear wheels move further inward, and this boy...

293
00:16:56,336 --> 00:16:58,505
-That's so lame! -It didn't hit him!

294
00:16:58,714 --> 00:17:01,091
He dodged me on purpose.

295
00:17:01,550 --> 00:17:03,844
If I don't do anything, I'll lose their respect...

296
00:17:04,052 --> 00:17:06,638
Damn you, Ryotsu!

297
00:17:06,972 --> 00:17:12,185
That was an example of how you might escape and possibly save your life.

298
00:17:12,394 --> 00:17:15,021
But you can't escape every time.

299
00:17:15,230 --> 00:17:17,149
Next is the real demonstration.

300
00:17:17,607 --> 00:17:20,110
Brace yourself, Ryotsu. I won't miss this time!

301
00:17:20,318 --> 00:17:22,279
Playtime is over.

302
00:17:22,487 --> 00:17:26,450
I'll dodge as many times as needed. I won't let you have your way!

303
00:17:26,658 --> 00:17:28,201
Here I go!

304
00:17:29,661 --> 00:17:33,957
You must be careful when riding parallel to trucks like this!

305
00:17:34,166 --> 00:17:37,085
Hey! Bikes can't go faster than trucks!

306
00:17:37,294 --> 00:17:39,588
It's to survive the traffic war!

307
00:17:43,759 --> 00:17:45,427
I won't let you get away!

308
00:17:49,931 --> 00:17:54,561
Like this, a truck could push you off the road at any time.

309
00:17:55,103 --> 00:17:57,314
Please be careful, everyone.

310
00:17:57,522 --> 00:17:59,566
You got him!

311
00:17:59,774 --> 00:18:04,654
Damn it! A truck jumped and spun into me. That's a lot more than a push!

312
00:18:04,863 --> 00:18:05,822
Boom!

313
00:18:06,156 --> 00:18:07,491
Like squabbling kids.

314
00:18:07,699 --> 00:18:10,494
I don't think this is a road safety workshop at all.

315
00:18:10,702 --> 00:18:15,123
In this unpredictable traffic war, let's survive by following the rules!

316
00:18:16,082 --> 00:18:19,920
"Unpredictable"? You'll regret saying that.

317
00:18:20,795 --> 00:18:24,925
I'll make you understand what that word really means, Chief!

318
00:18:25,509 --> 00:18:29,221
Next, 50cc motorcycle accidents, which are also common among women.

319
00:18:29,721 --> 00:18:33,350
Even a 50cc scooter can actually go quite fast.

320
00:18:33,558 --> 00:18:35,852
So, please make sure to ride safely.

321
00:18:36,394 --> 00:18:38,855
Thank you for waiting.

322
00:18:39,898 --> 00:18:44,694
Chief, please show them an example of how to drive safely.

323
00:18:44,903 --> 00:18:46,613
Well, all right.

324
00:18:47,739 --> 00:18:51,201
I've been waiting for this moment. Come on, get on the bike!

325
00:18:51,535 --> 00:18:54,371
Ryotsu, you're up to something.

326
00:18:56,039 --> 00:18:58,500
First, straddle the bike with the stand down.

327
00:18:58,708 --> 00:19:01,419
Of course, don't forget to wear a helmet.

328
00:19:01,628 --> 00:19:06,383
Before you start the engine and set off, check the surroundings carefully and...

329
00:19:07,926 --> 00:19:10,637
What the heck! It started running on its own!

330
00:19:10,846 --> 00:19:13,181
The handlebars and brakes don't work!

331
00:19:13,390 --> 00:19:16,851
Everyone, this is a bad example!

332
00:19:17,060 --> 00:19:20,981
I've modified that scooter to be radio controlled.

333
00:19:21,189 --> 00:19:24,818
Somebody, stop it! What's wrong with this scooter?

334
00:19:25,026 --> 00:19:27,320
Now, Honda! Burst in!

335
00:19:27,529 --> 00:19:28,572
Roger!

336
00:19:30,782 --> 00:19:33,702
Yeah! All-out safe driving!

337
00:19:36,871 --> 00:19:38,999
H-Honda! Why are you here?

338
00:19:39,207 --> 00:19:40,584
Check behind you!

339
00:19:44,838 --> 00:19:47,424
R-Ryotsu! Did you do this?

340
00:19:52,345 --> 00:19:56,474
Please don't ever drive like this.

341
00:19:58,101 --> 00:20:00,687
No one's listening. They are all glued to Honda.

342
00:20:00,896 --> 00:20:05,483
What an idiot! Honda, just show them how to drive safely!

343
00:20:08,153 --> 00:20:12,907
Next, let's experiment with a more dangerous car accident,

344
00:20:13,116 --> 00:20:15,160
using this ugly doll.

345
00:20:15,368 --> 00:20:19,164
Damn you, Chief. You're gonna make a fool of me.

346
00:20:20,415 --> 00:20:23,084
-A real Ferrari! Amazing! -Wow!

347
00:20:26,421 --> 00:20:31,968
As you can see, even at just under 20 kph, there's a lot of damage.

348
00:20:32,344 --> 00:20:34,054
Now, let's increase the speed,

349
00:20:34,262 --> 00:20:37,682
and continue the experiment to see how much the doll can withstand.

350
00:20:38,934 --> 00:20:40,852
Poor Ryo-chan doll!

351
00:20:41,061 --> 00:20:45,148
It's as if the real me is being tortured.

352
00:20:45,357 --> 00:20:46,733
Hey, Ryotsu.

353
00:20:47,275 --> 00:20:49,235
You gonna sit back and watch this happen?

354
00:20:49,444 --> 00:20:51,446
No..., I'm Kankichi Ryotsu,

355
00:20:51,655 --> 00:20:54,991
not the kind of man who would let himself be humiliated!

356
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:59,079
Next, let's try the experiment at 60 kph.

357
00:21:00,955 --> 00:21:03,917
Will the doll be able to withstand it?

358
00:21:04,334 --> 00:21:06,962
Even though it's a doll, I'm not really comfortable, but...

359
00:21:07,170 --> 00:21:08,546
Doesn't matter! Do it!

360
00:21:09,881 --> 00:21:11,132
Hold it right there!

361
00:21:12,967 --> 00:21:15,762
Hey! A bike shouldn't fall from the sky!

362
00:21:15,971 --> 00:21:20,266
The traffic war is unpredictable, isn't it, Chief?

363
00:21:20,684 --> 00:21:24,437
Damn it! He's determined to interrupt the workshop.

364
00:21:24,646 --> 00:21:26,231
Go, Nakagawa!

365
00:21:26,439 --> 00:21:27,273
Yes, sir.

366
00:21:36,282 --> 00:21:38,702
What are you doing? Can't you catch up?

367
00:21:38,910 --> 00:21:42,080
No. On such a narrow road, the bike has the advantage.

368
00:21:45,625 --> 00:21:47,877
What are you doing? Get going!

369
00:21:48,086 --> 00:21:51,381
No, I can't! There's oil spread on the road.

370
00:21:51,840 --> 00:21:53,466
I can't move forward or turn!

371
00:21:53,675 --> 00:21:55,093
What?

372
00:21:57,137 --> 00:21:58,096
Serves you right!

373
00:21:58,555 --> 00:22:00,640
The traffic war is really scary.

374
00:22:00,849 --> 00:22:04,602
You never know when someone might suddenly spill oil on the road.

375
00:22:04,811 --> 00:22:06,688
Gosh dang it, Ryotsu!

376
00:22:08,857 --> 00:22:11,276
All right! Let's finish it in one shot.

377
00:22:11,484 --> 00:22:13,486
Are you sure, Ryotsu?

378
00:22:13,695 --> 00:22:15,905
What's an ex-biker like you so afraid of?

379
00:22:16,114 --> 00:22:17,866
If you're gonna do it, go all the way!

380
00:22:18,074 --> 00:22:20,034
Okay! Let's do it!

381
00:22:21,828 --> 00:22:24,998
Let's dance and rock 'n' roll!

382
00:22:25,206 --> 00:22:26,416
Yeah!

383
00:22:32,589 --> 00:22:34,424
What are they doing?

384
00:22:34,632 --> 00:22:35,925
Ryo-chan!

385
00:22:36,134 --> 00:22:38,219
Wow! Is this possible?

386
00:22:38,428 --> 00:22:40,430
Huh? Quit trembling back there, Ryotsu!

387
00:22:40,930 --> 00:22:42,098
Here we go!

388
00:22:45,560 --> 00:22:47,604
Wow! So cool!

389
00:22:48,188 --> 00:22:50,190
Oh, they love it!

390
00:22:50,398 --> 00:22:53,985
Yeah! All out with double peace signs!

391
00:22:57,071 --> 00:23:01,367
"If you try, you can do it." This is the basic rule of the world!

392
00:23:01,576 --> 00:23:03,244
That's enough!

393
00:23:05,455 --> 00:23:09,584
Oh... Oh no!

394
00:23:09,793 --> 00:23:12,378
Come on! The workshop isn't over yet.

395
00:23:12,587 --> 00:23:15,632
-What are you doing, Chief? -Oh no! Stop scaring me!

396
00:23:16,716 --> 00:23:19,427
-Jeez! -So lame!

397
00:23:19,636 --> 00:23:23,306
Thank you all for attending this long workshop today.

398
00:23:23,515 --> 00:23:25,683
Now, we'll give the final demonstration.

399
00:23:25,892 --> 00:23:28,311
Two police officers, prepared to risk their lives,

400
00:23:28,520 --> 00:23:31,147
take on a car-to-car crash test.

401
00:23:31,356 --> 00:23:34,567
Please don't try this yourselves.

402
00:23:34,776 --> 00:23:38,071
Do it, Nakagawa! Crash into them at 100 kph!

403
00:23:38,279 --> 00:23:40,907
-Are you sure? -I don't care. Just do it!

404
00:23:44,202 --> 00:23:46,162
Chief! Get us out!

405
00:23:46,371 --> 00:23:47,997
I'm sorry, Chief!

406
00:23:48,206 --> 00:23:49,374
Stop!

407
00:23:49,582 --> 00:23:52,293
We're not crash test dummies!

408
00:23:56,756 --> 00:23:58,466
TODAY'S DAMAGE REPORT

409
00:23:58,675 --> 00:24:01,845
3 BIKES, 1 CAR, 1 RYOTSU DUMMY

410
00:24:04,681 --> 00:24:07,475
All right! There's a party at Nakagawa's house tomorrow.

411
00:24:07,684 --> 00:24:10,645
It's a birthday party for the prince of the Kingdom of Hondara.

412
00:24:10,854 --> 00:24:14,274
Since it's Nakagawa's house, I bet there'll be a ton of food.

413
00:24:14,482 --> 00:24:18,027
Okay, from today, I'm skipping food so I'll be extra hungry.

414
00:24:18,236 --> 00:24:21,281
NEXT EPISODE A VISIT TO THE NAKAGAWA RESIDENCE

415
00:24:21,489 --> 00:24:23,032
Don't miss it!

416
00:24:33,001 --> 00:24:37,297
Let's keep smiling always

417
00:24:37,922 --> 00:24:41,551
Even when things go wrong

418
00:24:41,759 --> 00:24:46,014
Keep a pretty smile on your face

419
00:24:46,639 --> 00:24:51,102
And go out as if nothing happened

420
00:24:51,644 --> 00:24:55,106
Hey, show me your smile

421
00:24:55,315 --> 00:24:59,360
You did nothing wrong

422
00:25:00,320 --> 00:25:03,781
Hey, show me your smile

423
00:25:03,990 --> 00:25:07,785
Just like you did before, yeah

424
00:25:07,994 --> 00:25:12,123
I want you to smile always

425
00:25:12,832 --> 00:25:17,295
A woman with a frown isn't pretty

426
00:25:17,795 --> 00:25:23,343
So you should smile as soon as you can

427
00:25:24,135 --> 00:25:27,096
It's the grown-up thing to do

428
00:25:39,275 --> 00:25:44,072
KOCHIKAME SEE YOU NEXT TIME!
